hange are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-01-28T17:12:44+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-28T17:12:44+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161524503,"discussion_id":"796cc763a1b485fc9d2546f3b3fc7a033b83b84d","body":"### CLA Signature Pass  \n xujiachen8, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1: ","created_at":"2026-01-28T17:12:44+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-28T17:12:44+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161524628,"discussion_id":"0658e36466a5c51b29612dc252a1c6421fe6232a","body":"### 代码结构与可维护性: 新增的常量 OVERFLOW_MODE_CTRL 使用了魔数 60，缺乏解释其含义的注释。该常量可能用于控制某种溢出模式或硬件特性，但仅凭名称和数值难以理解其具体用途和取值范围。在代码中直接使用未解释的魔数会降低代码的可读性和可维护性。\n\n**问题类型**: 代码结构与可维护性\n**文件路径**: `moe/moe_init_routing_v3/op_kernel/arch35/moe_v3_common.h`\n**行号**: 25\n**问题代码**:\n```unknown\nconstexpr int8_t OVERFLOW_MODE_CTRL = 60;\n```\n**修改建议**:\n```\n为常量 OVERFLOW_MODE_CTRL 添加注释，说明其含义、用途、取值范围以及为何选择数值 60。例如：// 溢出模式控制标志，用于设置硬件特定寄存器，有效范围 0-63，60 表示启用饱和溢出处理。\n```\n\n---\n*此评论由代码审查工具自动生成*","created_at":"2026-01-28T17:13:09+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-28T17:16:28+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"683fab01341da337ef327d4c","login":"xujiachen8","object_id":"683fab01341da337ef327d4c","name":"xujiachen8","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/xujiachen8"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":25,"end_new_line":25,"start_old_line":25,"end_old_line":25,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":161524632,"discussion_id":"df2c8e2174e96e72e4ac51b7aabe1ca1a44f13e5","body":"### 代码可读性/魔法数字: 新增的常量OVERFLOW_MODE_CTRL = 60是一个魔法数字，没有注释说明其含义和用途。结合代码上下文（AscendC架构相关代码），这个值可能是硬件特定的控制参数，但缺乏解释会让其他开发者难以理解其作用。\n\n**问题类型**: 代码可读性/魔法数字\n**文件路径**: `moe/moe_init_routing_v3/op_kernel/arch35/moe_v3_common.h`\n**行号**: 25\n**问题代码**:\n```unknown\nconstexpr int8_t OVERFLOW_MODE_CTRL = 60;\n```\n**修改建议**:\n```\n建议添加注释说明该常量的具体含义、用途以及为什么值是60。例如：'// Overflow mode control value for specific hardware operation, value 60 corresponds to XXX mode'。如果可能，还应说明这个值是否与硬件文档中的某个特定配置对应。\n```\n\n---\n*此评论由代码审查工具自动生成*","created_at":"2026-01-28T17:13:10+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-28T17:16:32+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"683fab01341da337ef327d4c","login":"xujiachen8","object_id":"683fab01341da337ef327d4c","name":"xujiachen8","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/xujiachen8"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":25,"end_new_line":25,"start_old_line":25,"end_old_line":25,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":161524748,"discussion_id":"60f5584f8587a70a76e60705534e157adea3ad2a","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR主要包含两项更新：一是统一更新了多个头文件和算子内核文件的版权年份声明。二是针对特定硬件架构（NPU 3101），为混合精度专家（MoE）路由初始化操作中的MXFP8量化模块增加了溢出模式控制机制。此修改旨在解决特定硬件平台上进行低精度量化计算时可能出现的溢出行为不一致问题，通过精确控制溢出模式，确保计算过程的稳定性和结果的可预测性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案分为两部分：首先，将相关文件的版权声明从“2025”更新为“2025-2026”。其次，在核心代码中，通过条件编译指令`#if (__NPU_ARCH__ == 3101)`，为NPU 3101架构引入了溢出控制寄存器（`OVERFLOW_MODE_CTRL`）的操作。具体包括在`moe_v3_gather_mxfp8_quant.h`的`Init`函数中设置该寄存器以控制量化行为，并在算子内核的`moe_init_routing_v3`函数执行前后，增加对同一寄存器的保存与恢复操作，从而确保算子执行不会意外改变全局溢出处理设置，保障了计算的隔离性和可靠性。","created_at":"2026-01-28T17:13:33+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-28T17:13:33+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161525624,"discussion_id":"b64fdf330d69ca5e8cae366cdcf680b8c36f7f93","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-01-28T17:16:54+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-28T17:16:54+08:00","user":{"id":"683fab01341da337ef327d4c","login":"xujiachen8","object_id":"683fab01341da337ef327d4c","name":"xujiachen8","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/xujiachen8"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161525760,"discussion_id":"ef96e6a684899259a703bfda43bcaf26c43f71f8","body":"流水线任务触发成功，任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=0d4f52bd3a494432a028df25bc3297f8&pipelineRunId=0b0a4607747e42029d50179842a45ffe&projectName=CANN'>0b0a4607747e42029d50179842a45ffe</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>codecheck</strong></td>\n                            <td>❌ FAILED</td>\n                            <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/entryCheckDashCode/MR_21e4dc8409db46ad90a723d2a846e736/c1b4fdc447932fcef59f2e2ddf54c5ae?projectId=300033&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                            <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        </tr> \n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>SCA</strong></td>\n            